  "notes": [
    "UE5 Legacy GBuffer variants derived from FGBufferParams: bHasVelocity, bHasTangent, bHasPrecShadowFactor.",
    "Format names use RenderDoc ResourceFormat.Name() strings. Each RT slot can list alternatives for UE precision/platform variants.",
    "RT0 Lighting/SceneColor allows R16G16B16A16_FLOAT because this project capture uses RGBA16F scene color instead of R11G11B10.",
    "Velocity RT follows updated 2026-06-07 docs: shader outputs float4, RG16 targets keep XY only, RGBA16_UNORM targets pack XY + DeviceZ delta high/low bits and low-bit flags.",
    "channel_schemas defines queryable per-RT channel semantics and unpack rules. Layout slots reference schemas by semantic key."
